+For provider-specific parameters that are not part of `ModelSettings`, use `extra_args` as an escape
+hatch. These keyword arguments are passed directly to the model provider's API. Since providers do
+not all support the same parameters, unsupported values can cause API errors.
+
+```python
+model_settings = ModelSettings(
+    temperature=0.1,
+    extra_args={"service_tier": "flex"},
+)
+```
+
